        "PMC7512535::web::030::5_summary"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed nanoscale precipitates will obstruct dislocation motion through precipitation strengthening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512535::web::025::4_2_ta_and_w_effects_at_room_temperature",
        "PMC7512535::web::030::5_summary"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Precipitation strengthening will increase the high-temperature yield strength of TiVNbTa.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512535::web::025::4_2_ta_and_w_effects_at_room_temperature",
        "PMC7512535::web::030::5_summary"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A fine precipitate dispersion can preserve substantial plasticity while increasing strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512535::web::025::4_2_ta_and_w_effects_at_room_temperature",
        "PMC7512535::web::030::5_summary"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent, finely distributed precipitates will not excessively scatter heat carriers and therefore will preserve TiVNbTa thermal conductivity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealed alloy will have an elevated-temperature yield-strength improvement on the order of tens of percent relative to the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealed alloy will retain sufficient ductility for use as a W-to-CuCrZr intermediate material.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealed alloy will retain sufficient thermal-transfer capability to bridge the operating ranges of W and CuCrZr.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment remains beneficial only while the precipitates resist coarsening at the operating temperature.",
